[["sonatrach-tos-1" :tos/full-text "PRIVACY POLICY OF SONATRACH SONATRACH attaches paramount importance to protecting your privacy and respecting your personal data. This privacy policy aims to inform you in a very clear and transparent manner about the collection, processing, use, and protection of the personal data you submit through our contact form. Collected Personal Data When you use our contact form, the following personal data are collected: Last name, First name, Email address, Phone number, Company name, Job title, Address, Message. This information is necessary to respond to your inquiries and for any subsequent communication related to your message. Purpose of Data Processing The personal data collected through the contact form is processed for the following purposes: To respond to requests or questions you submitted via the contact form, To communicate with you as part of our professional relationship, if applicable, To improve the quality of our services by identifying and understanding your needs, Please note that no sensitive personal data is collected through this form. Processing Legal Basis The processing of your data is based on the following legal foundations: Consent : By submitting the form, you explicitly consent to the processing of your personal data, Intérêt légitime : Pour gérer les communications entrantes liées à nos activités professionnelles. Data Recipients The collected data is strictly limited to: The collected data is strictly limited to: Our technical service providers (only for site maintenance or hosting purposes, and under binding agreements ensuring data confidentiality). Your data will not be shared with third parties without your prior consent, unless required by law. Data Retention Period Your personal data will be retained only for the time necessary to fulfill the purposes of processing: Ten (10) months after the last exchange for general inquiries, A longer period if required by legal or contractual obligations, A longer period if required by legal or contractual obligations, Data Security We implement appropriate technical and organizational security measures to protect your data against unauthorized access, loss, alteration, or disclosure. These measures include: Use of secure protocols (HTTPS), Restricted access to authorized personnel only, Regular audits to ensure the integrity of our systems, Your Rights In accordance with applicable regulations (Law 18-07), you have the following rights: Right of access – You can request access to the personal data we hold about you. Right of rectification – You may request correction of inaccurate or incomplete data. Right to erasure – You can request deletion of your data, subject to legal obligations. Right to object – You may object to the use of your data for certain purposes. To exercise your rights, please contact us at: [ contact_DonneesPerso@sonatrach.dz ] International Data Transfers Your personal data is not transferred outside the national territory. Updates to This Policy We reserve the right to update this policy to reflect legal or technical changes. Any substantial modifications will be communicated on this page." 1 :add]
